title: What a day in Vietnam actually costs
format: guide
voice: af_heart
music: upbeat
score: upbeat@1 cafe@5 upbeat@7 emotional@11 upbeat@15
sources: vietadvisor.travel daily costs 2026 (bánh mì 20–40k ₫, phở 40–60k ₫, iced coffee 20–35k ₫, bia hơi 10–15k ₫, GrabBike 20–50k ₫, dorm 100–300k ₫, museum 40k ₫); jackfruitadventure Hanoi street food (Apr 2026: phở 40–55k, bún chả 45–65k, bia hơi 7–15k); daytripsvietnam cost index 2026 (rate 26,025 ₫/USD); asiatouradvisor Hà Giang homestays ($6–15). All checked Oct 2026.
// ANGLE   The cheap things really are cheap. What empties your wallet is the visitor price of the same thing.
// SHAPE   Hook number → a day told in 8 objects (dawn → night) → running total → payoff → the trap → 4 rules → tease.
// COLOUR  dawn rose/violet → day sky blue + warm food grounds → night indigo + lantern gold → trap cold teal → rules brand blobs.
// MOTION  every cut is a content bridge: zoom INTO the cart → the sandwich; coffee FLOODS → the café; ripple → phở; lantern BLOOM → night;
//         the street SHATTERS into the receipt; bowl MATCHES coin. Something lands every 1–2 s (an ingredient, a price, a stamp, a clink).
// SOUND   street bed under the day, register on every price, splash/clink on liquids, music drops before the $17 payoff.
// VIRAL   number in the first second, a running total viewers compete with, one "trap" twist, a save card, an open loop to Ep.6.

// 0:00 HOOK — dawn street, camera rises off the road with scooters streaming past; "$17?" slams into the sky on the first word.
# nw focus=cafe cam=rise time=dawn head="$17?|one full day in Vietnam" dur=4.4
Seventeen dollars. A whole day in Vietnam.
Eight real prices. One trap.
// 0:05 the day in four beats — sun races across the sky, each object pops in on its word (clock in HEAD).
# vis kind=daycycle trans=blobs stops="06:30:banhmi:Bánh mì|09:00:caphe_phin:Cà phê|12:00:pho:Phở|19:00:biahoi:Bia hơi" sub="one ordinary day"
Breakfast.
Coffee.
Lunch.
A cold beer.
// 0:11 the cart — whip pan along the street, push in on the green cart, price tag swings off the awning.
# nw focus=cart cam=push zoom=1.35 time=dawn trans=whip tags="cart:25.000 ₫:≈ $1:1.0"
Breakfast first. A bánh mì from a cart. Twenty-five thousand dong.
// 0:15 ZOOM THROUGH the cart glass → the sandwich builds itself, one ingredient per word, lid snaps shut with crumbs.
# vis kind=build set=banhmi trans=zoomthru tc=.5,.52 parts="pate:PÂTÉ|pork:GRILLED PORK|pickles:PICKLED CARROT|cucumber:CUCUMBER|herbs:CORIANDER|chili:CHILI|sauce:MAGGI" sub="inside a 25k bánh mì" final="25.000 ₫|about one dollar"
For one dollar you get
pâté,
grilled pork,
pickled carrot,
cucumber,
coriander,
fresh chili,
and a splash of Maggi.
// 0:27 coffee FLOODS the frame (liquid bridge) → phin drips, ice drops with a splash, phin lifts away, milk swirls.
# vis kind=coffee bg=wine trans=liquid tcol=#6a3a1e head="20.000 ₫|iced coffee on a stool" price="20.000 ₫" sub="≈ $0.80"
Then coffee, dripped slowly through a phin…
over ice. Twenty thousand.
// 0:34 whip → GrabBike races across the frame, city strip rushing, app card pops with a fixed price.
# vis kind=ride bg=sea trans=whip head="30.000 ₫|across town by GrabBike" price="30.000 ₫"
Across town by GrabBike: thirty thousand.
The price is fixed in the app.
// 0:40 RIPPLE lands on the phở stall at noon; steam rises; camera drifts.
# nw focus=pho cam=drift zoom=1.5 time=day trans=ripple tc=.5,.5 head="NOON|phở on the sidewalk"
Lunch is phở, from a pot that's been going since five a.m.
// 0:44 ZOOM INTO the pot → the bowl builds: broth pours, noodles, rare beef turning brown in the heat, herbs, lime.
# vis kind=build set=pho bg=ember trans=zoomthru tc=.42,.55 parts="broth:BROTH|noodles:RICE NOODLES|beef:RARE BEEF|herbs:HERBS|lime:LIME" sub="a 45k bowl" final="45.000 ₫|under two dollars"
Broth simmered all night,
rice noodles,
rare beef that cooks in the bowl,
herbs,
and lime.
// 0:52 SLICES → running total prints; viewers race the counter.
# vis kind=receipt trans=slices bg=teal items="banhmi:Bánh mì:25000|caphe_phin:Cà phê:20000|scooter:GrabBike:30000|pho:Phở:45000" final="120.000 ₫|spent by noon · ≈ $4.60" sub="spent so far"
Bánh mì.
Coffee.
A ride.
Phở.
By noon: a hundred and twenty thousand. Under five dollars.
// 1:00 CUBE turn → museum facade, ticket slides out of the slot, PAID stamp slams.
# vis kind=ticket bg=plum trans=cube head="40.000 ₫|a museum ticket" price="40.000 ₫"
Afternoon: a museum ticket, forty thousand.
// 1:04 lantern BLOOM → the street at night, string lights on, bia hơi corner filling up.
# nw focus=biahoi cam=push zoom=1.35 time=night trans=bloom tc=.5,.3 tcol=#ffd98a head="NIGHT|the bia hơi corner"
Evening. Bia hơi, brewed this morning, poured onto plastic stools.
// 1:09 ZOOM INTO a glass → two glasses rise, clink, foam bursts; counter doubles.
# vis kind=cheers bg=indigo trans=zoomthru tc=.5,.6
Ten thousand a glass.
Two glasses… still under a dollar.
// 1:15 MATCH the round glass top onto the round bowl → bún chả builds over charcoal smoke.
# vis kind=build set=buncha bg=ember trans=match tc=.5,.55 tc2=.5,.62 parts="patties:GRILLED PATTIES|pork:PORK BELLY|papaya:PICKLED PAPAYA|noodles:NOODLES|herbs:HERBS" sub="55k bún chả" final="55.000 ₫|dinner"
Dinner: bún chả, grilled over charcoal.
Patties,
pork belly,
pickled papaya,
noodles,
and a basket of herbs.
// 1:26 DROP → the bunk bed builds itself: mattresses fall, pillows bounce, blanket rolls out, moon in the window.
# vis kind=bed bg=night trans=drop head="200.000 ₫|a dorm bed" price="200.000 ₫" sub="≈ $8"
And a dorm bed for the night: two hundred thousand.
// 1:31 the whole street SHATTERS into tiles that land as the receipt; music drops out before the total.
# vis kind=receipt trans=burst bg=night items="banhmi:Bánh mì:25000|caphe_phin:Cà phê:20000|scooter:GrabBike:30000|pho:Phở:45000|ticket:Museum:40000|biahoi:Bia hơi ×2:20000|buncha:Bún chả:55000|backpack:Dorm bed:200000" final="435.000 ₫|≈ $17 for the whole day"
Eight things.
One whole day.
Four hundred and thirty-five thousand dong.
About seventeen dollars.
// 1:42 SPIN out to the mountains — Hà Giang at sunset, mist drifting through karst, a lit stilt house.
# vis kind=hagiang trans=spin head="155.000 ₫|a homestay in Hà Giang" price="155.000 ₫" sub="dinner included"
And that's a city price.
Up in Hà Giang, a homestay bed is a hundred and fifty-five thousand.
Dinner included.
// 1:50 STRIPES → cold day light on the gold lobby café; price tag swings: the twist.
# nw focus=hotel cam=push time=day trans=stripes2 head="THE TRAP|50 metres from the stool café" tags="hotel:90.000 ₫:same coffee:1.2"
Now the one nobody warns you about.
// 1:54 MATCH → the same coffee side by side; prices count up; the expensive one stays lit, verdict slams.
# vis kind=vs bg=teal trans=match a=caphe_phin an="STREET STOOL" pa=20000 b=caphe_suada bn="HOTEL LOBBY" pb=90000 win=a head="SAME COFFEE" verdict="4.5× MORE|for the chair"
Same iced coffee, fifty metres apart.
Twenty thousand… or ninety.
You're paying for the chair.
// 2:03 BLOBS → the save card: four rules pop in on their words.
# vis kind=grid trans=blobs items="stool:Eat where stools are full|money:Agree the price first|phone:Book rides in the app|!caphe_suada:Skip lobby cafés" head="SAVE THIS|before your trip"
Eat where the stools are already full.
Agree a price before you get on anything.
Book rides in the app.
And skip the lobby café.
// 2:12 ZOOM THROUGH → a narrow street at night, a train's headlight blooms toward the lens: open loop to Ep.6.
# vis kind=trainstreet trans=zoomthru tc=.5,.5 head="NEXT|Train Street"
Next time: the most filmed street in Hà Nội…
and why sitting on it is against the rules.
